.kgk..kghhhhhhhhhhhhhgk.
.kgk..kggggggggggggggggk
.kgk..kgkkkkkkkgkkkgkk..
..kggggk......kgk.kgk...
...kkkk.......kgk.kgk...
..............kkk.kkk...
........................
........................
........................
........................

